56	      // `activate` (not `focus`): on re-entry with the same workroom it pulls fresh (and retries a
57	      // prior failure), so switching away and back after a terminal commit shows the new log — where
58	      // `focus` would no-op on the unchanged root. The store's eager `focus` on selection still fires
59	      // first; `activate`'s settled-state guard means this won't double that fresh load.
60	      model.activate(store.inspectorTarget.map { URL(fileURLWithPath: $0.path) })
